Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:54:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] Android: Add LibWebAndroid integration layer for HTML
 rendering

- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/LibWebAndroid.{h,cpp}: LibWeb/LibJS initialization and Page management API
  - initialize_libweb_for_android(): Initialize LibCore::EventLoop, JS::VM, Web bindings
  - create_web_page(): Create LibWeb::Page with viewport size
  - web_page_load_url/resize/mouse_event/render(): LibWeb operations (stubs until engine linked)
- WebContentProcess: Call LibWebAndroid functions in thread loop (initialize, create page, dispatch events, render)
- AndroidViewImplementation/LibWebAndroid: Fix unused parameter warnings with [[maybe_unused]]
- WebContentProcess: Add <cerrno> for errno/EINTR/EAGAIN
- CMakeLists.txt: Link LibWebAndroid.cpp into both ladybird_android and ladybird_android_bootstrap

Bootstrap APK builds and runs. WebContent thread initializes, creates LibWeb::Page stub (returns nullptr until linked), processes IPC messages. Surface clears to white. Next: Link real LibWeb/LibJS after vcpkg manifest.
